        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded on a mysterious planet after a failed expedition, your last hope is the beam at the top. To reach it, you must climb through the ruins of an ancient civilization, unlocking more jumps and dashes at every gate they left behind. Embark on a challenging adventure that takes you through an atmospheric world, from serene sunsets and thunderstorms to cities in the clouds. Every fall sends you back to the mysterious Beacon that binds you to the planet, but with persistence, you can finally break the loop and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/ef8cc53734921299cc4ad011759bcdc7.webp?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f237dd106415f8bc0bc28490855fce57.poster.avif?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f237dd106415f8bc0bc28490855fce57.webm?t=1762983707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f237dd106415f8bc0bc28490855fce57.mp4?t=1762983707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform sequences of multiple air jumps and dashes, where you have to master the responsive controls and mid-air movement to navigate crazier and crazier jumps. Take leaps of faith, go around corners, and face your fear of heights as you're constantly thinking mid-air &quot;Can I make it?&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/f0d8e49275e7a641e4430f39add9fa8d.webp?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/78230aeac12c6027b6ea2a55056027d5.poster.avif?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/78230aeac12c6027b6ea2a55056027d5.webm?t=1762983707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/78230aeac12c6027b6ea2a55056027d5.mp4?t=1762983707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with 1 jump and build up your movement skills gate by gate. Learn the increasingly more complicated jump sequences one jump or dash at a time as you travel through the game world and become the master of air jumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/b23fcb23bf889b65b195948bbe3ceba7.webp?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/8f4d1962ed4771ff2cc3a7732f85efd7.poster.avif?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/8f4d1962ed4771ff2cc3a7732f85efd7.webm?t=1762983707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/8f4d1962ed4771ff2cc3a7732f85efd7.mp4?t=1762983707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the view and relaxing atmosphere as you find your way up through the mysterious alien structures. The scenery and mood ranges from exotic jungle to beautiful sunsets, thunderstorms, dark caves at the mountainside, and towering cities built above clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/c341b50af1e52773c0b693bb80b08637.webp?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/36187ea5d47c4519c2fd36f540101ef3.poster.avif?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/36187ea5d47c4519c2fd36f540101ef3.webm?t=1762983707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/36187ea5d47c4519c2fd36f540101ef3.mp4?t=1762983707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to take the unforgiving challenge for the glory? Or explore the environment at your own pace and find secrets as you go? The game features 3 difficulty modes and various achievements to encourage different playstyles and fun ways to play through the game many times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/921def2d51ddfa6974d422c5a896164a.avif?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=261 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging vertical platforming:</strong> Master the responsive controls, precise platforming, and mid-air movement to navigate tricky jumping sequences and leaps of faith.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new abilities:</strong> Progress unlocks more jumps and dashes, allowing you to solve even crazier jumps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric world: </strong>Explore the remnants of an ancient civilization through breathtaking visuals, relaxing sound design, and progressing mood and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden secrets:</strong> 24+ collectibles and easter eggs hidden so well even the developers can't find them. Secret paths to cut those valuable seconds out of your speedrun time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable difficulty:</strong> Choose from the difficulty modes based on your liking. Play with checkpoints or no checkpoints for achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various achievements:</strong> Play through the game many times with different twists to reach for the achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/118bb504dbb476eb89eb79aa6d2763ba.webp?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the jumping puzzles of games like Destiny 2, DOOM Eternal, and A Story About My Uncle, and the progressing mood and beauty of games like Journey, Jumpbound invites you to a proper challenge that ensures a relaxing experience even in the face of failure. Treat every fall as an opportunity to learn something new and face your fear of heights as you reach for the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448250/extras/bbfc935ebf3b4a100ecb18ab26d3a495.webp?t=1762983707\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p>",
